        },
        {
          "text": " Kwa maana BWANA amewamwagieni roho ya usingizi, amefumba macho yenu, yaani, manabii; amefunika vichwa vyenu, yaani, waonaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.10",
